# Changes to the delivery path need a security review (DSO-01).
# GitHub and GitLab both read this file; on Azure DevOps use a branch policy
# with required reviewers on the same paths. Replace the team names with yours.
/.github/            @your-org/security-team
/.gitlab-ci.yml      @your-org/security-team
/ci/                 @your-org/security-team
/azure-pipelines.yml @your-org/security-team
/azure-devops/       @your-org/security-team
/Jenkinsfile         @your-org/security-team
/jenkins/            @your-org/security-team
/scripts/            @your-org/security-team
/deploy/             @your-org/platform-team @your-org/security-team
